<title>USA: N.Y. State Thruway bonds repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>N.Y. State Thruway bonds repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Tuesday it repriced New York State Thruway Authority's $277.8 million bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2016 to approximately 6.081 percent from 6.10 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>NEW YORK STATE THRUWAY AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $277,755,000*</p>
<p>LOCAL HIGHWAY AND BRIDGE SERVICE CONTRACT BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING 1998 THRU 2000, 2010 AND 2016.</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Baa1		  S&amp;P: BBB</p>
<p>    DATED: 09/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 04/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>04/01/1997		4,345M    4.50  %	  4.20</p>
<p>04/01/1998		8,635M    4.45  %	100.00</p>
<p>04/01/1999		9,025M    4.60  %	  4.70</p>
<p>04/01/2000		9,450M    4.875 %	  4.95</p>
<p>04/01/2001		9,910M    5.50  %	  5.10</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>04/01/2002	     10,415M    5.125 %	  5.20</p>
<p>04/01/2003	     10,950M    5.25  %	  5.30</p>
<p>04/01/2004	     11,525M    5.30  %	  5.40</p>
<p>04/01/2005	     12,215M    6.00  %	  5.50</p>
<p>04/01/2006	     12,950M    5.50  %	  5.60</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>04/01/2007	     13,675M    5.625 %	  5.75</p>
<p>04/01/2008	     14,445M    5.75  %	  5.85</p>
<p>04/01/2009	     15,275M    5.75  %	  5.95</p>
<p>04/01/2010	     16,155M    5.75  %	 97.875</p>
<p>04/01/2016	    118,785M    5.75  %	 96.25</p>
<p>						    (Approx. Yield 6.081)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 04/01/2006    102.00</p>
